    LLM: 'Game: Krypkasino. Logic: Avoidance fishing game. Key: Forced capture, avoid penalty cards, Tabbe = -1 point.',
    Player: 'Krypkasino is a Swedish avoidance version of Casino. Try to avoid capturing cards, especially penalty cards (10 Diamonds=2pts, 2 Spades=1pt, Aces=1pt). Forced capture rule: if you can capture, you must. Clearing the table (Tabbe) gives -1 point.',
    tagline: 'Avoid capturing cards in this reverse-fishing game.',
